<div class="forest-instructions-board">
  <div id="instructions-title">Python Puzzle 3</div>
  <div id="instructions-body">The guest list is given below. Ask for a name with input().
If the name is on the list, print Welcome, NAME!
— otherwise print Sorry, NAME is not on the list.
Finish by printing the guest count with len().
Run it twice: once with a name on the list, once with a name that is not.</div>
  <div id="instructions-given">Given:  guests = ['Ava', 'Ben', 'Cai', 'Dee', 'Eli']</div>
  <div id="instructions-expected-label">Sample Run:</div>
  <div id="instructions-expected">Name: Cai
Welcome, Cai!
Guests on list: 5</div>
</div>
